 "note": "Two bowls (home rings) pinched into a waist of K 30 junctions (mirror). A rotor at the top and bottom of the waist joins the two K arms through the neck (r1) or the bowls' rims over the shoulders (r2): the crossing always exists, but it jumps between the neck and the rims.",
